# ========================================
# CampusPlay Frontend Environment Variables
# ========================================

# API Configuration
# -----------------
# Backend API URL (no trailing slash)
# Development: http://localhost:5000
# Production: https://your-backend.onrender.com or https://your-backend.up.railway.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://campusplay-4g0z.onrender.com

# Socket.io Configuration
# -----------------------
# Socket.io server URL (same as API URL)
# Development: http://localhost:5000
# Production: https://your-backend.onrender.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_SOCKET_URL=https://campusplay-4g0z.onrender.com
# ========================================
# Production Examples:
# - Render: https://campusplay-backend.onrender.com
# - Railway: https://campusplay-backend.up.railway.app
# - Heroku: https://campusplay-backend.herokuapp.com
# ========================================

# ========================================
# Deployment Notes:
# - Vercel: Set in Environment Variables section
# - Netlify: Set in Site settings > Environment variables
# - Must start with NEXT_PUBLIC_ to be accessible in browser
# - NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL and NEXT_PUBLIC_SOCKET_URL should be the same
# - After setting environment variables, redeploy the project
# ========================================
